id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"58-df-finite\">58-df-finite</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,\\Gamma,\\tau_w\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,\\Gamma,\\tau_w\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11EmbeddingMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11EmbeddingMap}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> are supplied by the dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_0(\\Gamma)\">\\(c_0(\\Gamma)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell^1(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\ell^1(\\Gamma)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WeakCZeroFunctional}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{WeakCZeroFunctional}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WeakCZeroTopology}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{WeakCZeroTopology}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9EberleinCompactum}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9EberleinCompactum}_S\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}c0}\\vdash\nc_0(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\\left\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^\\Gamma:\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\mathrm{Finite}\\bigl(\\{\\gamma\\in\\Gamma:|x(\\gamma)|\\geq\\varepsilon\\}\\bigr)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}c0}\\vdash\nc_0(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\\left\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^\\Gamma:\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\mathrm{Finite}\\bigl(\\{\\gamma\\in\\Gamma:|x(\\gamma)|\\geq\\varepsilon\\}\\bigr)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}l1}\\vdash\n\\ell^1(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\\left\\{a\\in\\mathbb R^\\Gamma:\n\\exists B\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall F\\subseteq\\Gamma\\;\n\\left(\\mathrm{Finite}(F)\\to\\sum_{\\gamma\\in F}|a(\\gamma)|\\leq B\\right)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}l1}\\vdash\n\\ell^1(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\\left\\{a\\in\\mathbb R^\\Gamma:\n\\exists B\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall F\\subseteq\\Gamma\\;\n\\left(\\mathrm{Finite}(F)\\to\\sum_{\\gamma\\in F}|a(\\gamma)|\\leq B\\right)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}weak\\text{-}c0\\text{-}functional}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WeakCZeroFunctional}_S(\\ell,a,\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;a\\in\\ell^1(\\Gamma)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\ell,c_0(\\Gamma),\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x\\in c_0(\\Gamma)\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\exists F_0\\subseteq\\Gamma\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Finite}(F_0)\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{55pt}\\forall F\\subseteq\\Gamma\\;\\bigl((\\mathrm{Finite}(F)\\land F_0\\subseteq F)\n\\to |\\ell(x)-\\sum_{\\gamma\\in F}a(\\gamma)x(\\gamma)|&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}weak\\text{-}c0\\text{-}functional}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WeakCZeroFunctional}_S(\\ell,a,\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;a\\in\\ell^1(\\Gamma)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\ell,c_0(\\Gamma),\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x\\in c_0(\\Gamma)\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\exists F_0\\subseteq\\Gamma\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Finite}(F_0)\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{55pt}\\forall F\\subseteq\\Gamma\\;\\bigl((\\mathrm{Finite}(F)\\land F_0\\subseteq F)\n\\to |\\ell(x)-\\sum_{\\gamma\\in F}a(\\gamma)x(\\gamma)|&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}weak\\text{-}c0}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WeakCZeroTopology}_S(\\tau_w,\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\tau_{\\mathbb R}=\\left\\{O\\subseteq\\mathbb R:\\forall r\\in O\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall s\\in\\mathbb R\\;( |s-r|&lt;\\varepsilon\\to s\\in O)\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_{\\mathbb R},\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_w,c_0(\\Gamma))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall a\\in\\ell^1(\\Gamma)\\;\\exists\\ell\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{WeakCZeroFunctional}_S(\\ell,a,\\Gamma)\n\\land\\forall O\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\;(\\ell^{-1}[O]\\in\\tau_w)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\rho\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Top}(\\rho,c_0(\\Gamma))\\land\n\\forall a\\in\\ell^1(\\Gamma)\\;\\exists\\ell\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{WeakCZeroFunctional}_S(\\ell,a,\\Gamma)\n\\land\\forall O\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\;(\\ell^{-1}[O]\\in\\rho)\\right)\n\\to\\tau_w\\subseteq\\rho\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}weak\\text{-}c0}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WeakCZeroTopology}_S(\\tau_w,\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\tau_{\\mathbb R}=\\left\\{O\\subseteq\\mathbb R:\\forall r\\in O\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall s\\in\\mathbb R\\;( |s-r|&lt;\\varepsilon\\to s\\in O)\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_{\\mathbb R},\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_w,c_0(\\Gamma))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall a\\in\\ell^1(\\Gamma)\\;\\exists\\ell\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{WeakCZeroFunctional}_S(\\ell,a,\\Gamma)\n\\land\\forall O\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\;(\\ell^{-1}[O]\\in\\tau_w)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\rho\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Top}(\\rho,c_0(\\Gamma))\\land\n\\forall a\\in\\ell^1(\\Gamma)\\;\\exists\\ell\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{WeakCZeroFunctional}_S(\\ell,a,\\Gamma)\n\\land\\forall O\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\;(\\ell^{-1}[O]\\in\\rho)\\right)\n\\to\\tau_w\\subseteq\\rho\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}eberlein\\text{-}compactum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9EberleinCompactum}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\n\\exists\\Gamma,\\tau_w,h\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{WeakCZeroTopology}_S(\\tau_w,\\Gamma)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11EmbeddingMap}_S(h,X,\\tau,c_0(\\Gamma),\\tau_w)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}eberlein\\text{-}compactum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9EberleinCompactum}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\n\\exists\\Gamma,\\tau_w,h\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{WeakCZeroTopology}_S(\\tau_w,\\Gamma)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11EmbeddingMap}_S(h,X,\\tau,c_0(\\Gamma),\\tau_w)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The Euclidean topology, finite-support bounds, and the value of every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell^1\">\\(\\ell^1\\)</span> functional are all defined extensionally; no hidden <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\)</span> or meta-level infinite sum remains.</li>\n<li>The weak topology is the least topology induced by the explicit <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell^1(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\ell^1(\\Gamma)\\)</span> dual pairing, rather than an undeclared symbol <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma(c_0,c_0^*)\">\\(\\sigma(c_0,c_0^*)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Since <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> is compact and the weak <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_0(\\Gamma)\">\\(c_0(\\Gamma)\\)</span> topology is Hausdorff, the embedded range is weakly compact.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space","status":"resolved","id":"3639c3f839b6c954","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-topo11-embedding-map","status":"resolved","id":"1f3d06b50063e064","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-topo11-embedding-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topology","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topology]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"5